-- title:
--   Source-exact zero-jump stopped strict prepayment reward is L1 and expected no more than w(x)
-- statement:
--   For the original zero-jump Gaussian Lévy process and admissible dividend strategy, the zero-clock-masked positive stopped prepayment reserve plus strict-before-clock discounted Stieltjes dividend reward is integrable and has expectation bounded by w(x) at every bounded stopped clock. This is the exact analytic core of the previously published single-centred-martingale witness; the witness then follows by subtracting its expectation.
